# A real Claude Code session using the skill from this checkout on your default channel. Edited by record.sh.
Output out/agent_raw.mp4
Source common.tape
Set Width 1280
Set Height 1020
Set TypingSpeed 22ms

Hide
Type "source shell.sh agent"
Enter
Sleep 1s
Type "claude"
Enter
Sleep 8s
Show

Sleep 400ms
Type "What were my top 3 videos in the last 28 days, and where did their views come from? Keep it short."
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 40s
